Description:You control a face-down Blightsteel Colossus (a 2/2 with no abilities), two Mountains and a Swamp, and have Fling and Reanimate in hand. The opponent is at 20 life. End the turn with Blightsteel Colossus on your battlefield and the opponent at 18 life.
